errors into HTTP status codes.\"}]}], \"confidence\": 0.82, \"dependency_list\": \"[]\", \"known_limitations\": \"[\\\"The intent asks to refactor mapStoreError 'if needed'. It already exists in main.go as a single-source-of-truth switch over errors.Is, so no refactor was applied; only new admin handlers were added that call it.\\\", \\\"No test_generator stage is present in pipeline_stages, so new admin handler behavior (e.g. method-not-allowed and required-param handling) is not covered by generated tests.\\\", \\\"The new admin endpoint paths (/admin/delete, /admin/lookup) and their request shapes are my choice; the intent did not specify exact routes or signatures, so they may need adjustment to match expectations.\\\", \\\"adminDeleteHandler cannot surface store errors because Store.Delete returns no error; the shared table is only exercised by adminLookupHandler.\\\"]\", \"intent\": \"Add admin HTTP handlers that reuse the existing mapStoreError table in main.go instead of introducing a second mapping.\", \"language\": \"go\"}","id":"chatcmpl-tool-621f28d78623467ead67522a7cf23224","runId":"run_20260918155254_8ae854","schemaVersion":2,"type":"tool_call_delta"}
